   "heading": "your West Side JC mom and pop Pot Shop",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "About Us",
     "role": "kicker"
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "We started this shop to create a space where everyone feels comfortable, welcome, and taken care of."
    }
   ],
   "headingLevel": 1,
   "headingAccent": "mom and pop"
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "src": "bde-section-122-114",
   "heading": "",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "img",
     "src": "/assets/photos/ll/ladyl_eye_logo_5x5-1.webp",
     "alt": "LadyL_Eye_Logo_5x5",
     "orig": "https://ladyljerseycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/LadyL_Eye_Logo_5x5-1.webp",
     "w": 1500,
     "h": 1500
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "Lady L Cannabis is <em>your</em> locally owned, independent, <a href=\"https://ladyljerseycity.com/new-jersey/\">West Side Jersey City dispensary</a>."
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "Just neighbors that enjoy cannabis that are excited to share with our community the benefits and joy of legal, adult-use cannabis."
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "We’re easy to talk to, always listening, and open to shaping this place with you. This isn’t just our dispensary—it’s yours too."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "our-purpose",
   "src": "bde-section-122-120",
   "heading": "Our Purpose",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "We exist to create <strong>personal and joyful cannabis shopping experiences</strong> that <strong>reflect and serve our local community</strong>—driven by passion, purpose, and an <strong>unstoppable spirit rooted in family and community</strong>."
    }
   ],
   "headingLevel": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "our-core-values",
   "src": "bde-section-122-124",
   "heading": "Our core valueS",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "faq",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "Customer and Community First",
       "a_html": "<p>We exist for our neighbors. Our decisions, our service, and our space are built around the people we serve.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Connecting People With The Plant",
       "a_html": "<p>We’re here to break the stigma. We believe cannabis is a powerful, personal, and natural part of wellness—and it deserves to be treated that way.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Always Accessible",
       "a_html": "<p>No gatekeeping, no attitude—just real people and open doors. We believe cannabis should be approachable, inclusive, and judgment-free.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Rooted in Local",
       "a_html": "<p>New Jersey made us who we are. As a West Side mom-and-pop, we’re proud to keep it homegrown, independent, and locally driven.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Curated with Care",
       "a_html": "<p>We’re thoughtful about what we put on our shelves—handpicking products we’d be excited to share with our own friends and family.</p>"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "headingLevel": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "were-just-a-short-trip-from-most-jersey-city-neighborhoods",
