   "heading": "We’re just a short trip from most Jersey City neighborhoods",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "<strong>We’re within walking distance (“dogwalker or two” distance 😉💨)</strong> or a brief <strong>5 minute drive</strong> from"
